params.notes:
* '''Sett''' will afterwards attempt to basic attack the closest target picked up by ''Facebreaker'', prioritising champions and prioritising those in front of him.
* If ''Facebreaker'' does not hit an enemy, {{ai|Haymaker|Sett}} is also unable to be cast for {{fd|0.25}} seconds after the cast time.
* Targets will be pulled towards '''Sett's''' location in a straight line and rebound to 150 units from him back in the same line.
* The [[spell indicator]] is slightly shorter than the actual hitbox' rectangle length, and slightly wider than the width (note that the effects are edge-range from the hitbox rectangle).
* Targets protected by {{tip|spell shield|spell shields}} don't count toward the requirement to {{tip|stun}}.
* ''Facebreaker's'' cast generates an additional stack of {{ri|Hail of Blades}} despite the ability not {{tip|basic attack reset|resetting}} his basic attack timer.{{bug}}
** This is due to the spell incorrectly having the <code>Trait_AttackReset</code> spell tag.
